# Veyran, Voice of Duality's "copying an instant or sorcery spell" is a copy of a spell (CR 707.10); copying a card in
# another zone is not (the rulings: "Some effects instruct you to copy an instant or sorcery card in a zone other than the
# stack. These copies do not cause magecraft abilities to trigger. However, ... casting the copy will cause magecraft
# abilities to trigger"). Bot1 Bolts Bot2 on turn 1 with Veyran out (magecraft twice). On turn 5 Uldaros Theorix enters,
# exiles that Lightning Bolt from the graveyard, copies it and casts the copy at Bot2: magecraft triggers twice, for the
# cast - not four times - and Veyran is a 4/4.
# Turn 1: Mox Sapphire, Mox Ruby and Mox Jet pay Veyran; the Volcanic Island pays the Bolt. Turn 5: Mox Sapphire, Mox Jet,
# both Swamps, Mox Ruby and the Volcanic Island pay Uldaros' {3}{U}{B}{B}.

